<div class="container my-5">

  <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4">

    <div class="card-header bg-success text-white p-4">

      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1">

        🔄 Express Session Request Flow

      </h2>

      <p class="mb-0">

        Complete lifecycle of an Express Session Authentication System.

      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="card-body">

      <div class="alert alert-info">

        This diagram explains how the browser, Express Server,
        Session Middleware and Cookie work together during login.

      </div>

      <pre class="bg-dark text-light p-4 rounded">

        🚀 Server Starts
               │
               ▼
     Session Middleware Loaded
               │
               ▼
      Browser Opens /login
               │
               ▼
        GET /login Request
               │
               ▼
      Session Route Called
               │
               ▼
      loginPage() Controller
               │
               ▼
        Render login.ejs
               │
               ▼
     User Enters Credentials
               │
               ▼
        POST /login
               │
               ▼
      loginUser() Controller
               │
               ▼
      Validate Email & Password
               │
      ┌────────┴────────┐
      │                 │
      ▼                 ▼
 Invalid Login      Valid Login
      │                 │
      ▼                 ▼
 Show Error      Create Session
                      │
                      ▼
      req.session.user = {...}
      req.session.isLogin = true
      req.session.loginTime = new Date()
                      │
                      ▼
      Session Stored on Server
                      │
                      ▼
      Session ID Generated
                      │
                      ▼
 Browser Receives Cookie (connect.sid)
                      │
                      ▼
 Redirect To /dashboard
                      │
                      ▼
      GET /dashboard
                      │
                      ▼
 Authentication Middleware
                      │
              Is Logged In ?
             ┌──────┴──────┐
             │             │
             ▼             ▼
            No            Yes
             │             │
             ▼             ▼
 Redirect /login     Dashboard Page
                           │
                           ▼
                  Access Profile Page
                           │
                           ▼
                Access Session Info
                           │
                           ▼
                  Click Logout Button
                           │
                           ▼
                 GET /logout Route
                           │
                           ▼
        req.session.destroy()
                           │
                           ▼
     Browser Cookie Cleared
                           │
                           ▼
        Redirect /login
                           │
                           ▼
            Session Finished

</pre>

    </div>

  </div>

</div>


